        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#22$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "Hey, you're the one who invited me. Say something. I skipped the banquet celebrating the completion of the First Temple for you, you know."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "You were a big part of getting the work across the finish line the day before the exchange ceremony. Tradition calls for a full day of celebration. The craftsmen began drinking and reciting poetry in broad daylight."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Not all of them hold their drink well. Guess the peace officers will have their hands full tonight."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "Kantia from the moving crew, right? She's really taken to you after you helped her a few times."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Yeah... it's been like a dream, coming to Athenius."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "Right you are."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "First day in Athenius, you solved the dispute between the fruit farmers and craftsmen. Then you became the supervisor of the final phase of the temple rebuilding project."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "And you chased Xanthos over multiple blocks after the harp was stolen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "Way more interesting than just escorting a relic, isn't it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "But my job was to ensure that the exchange ceremony goes smoothly, and promote the friendship between our two nations."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "What's the matter, Titi? This isn't like you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Pallas..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "The harp of Kereseira we brought... it's a replica."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#17$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "What?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "I would never have known, if the harp wasn't damaged during my scuffle with Xanthos."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Now, my deputy, Behnui, wants to fulfill the padishah's mission by handing over the fake harp in the exchange ceremony... but I know that's not right."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "The ceremony is tomorrow. Do you have a solution?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "There's no good way to do this. We'd need a miracle."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "I read through every relevant book I could borrow from the Bibliotheka of Athenius. I learned that the harp of Kereseira was lost to war a long time ago, and it hasn't been seen since."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "It's likely that the Sargonian craftsmen who made this replica had only seen the blueprints, not the harp itself."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "Could the true harp still be in Minos? Or..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Or it was destroyed by the fires of war long ago... I'm sorry."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "There's no need for you to apologize."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "What do you plan to do, if the true harp is nowhere to be found?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "I can't publicly announce in my capacity as Sargonian ambassador that we brought a fake harp. It's more likely to lead to conflict than to reveal the truth."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "A very reasonable concern."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "And so, I'll have to stop the ceremony in my personal capacity."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#2$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "I'm getting rid of the fake harp before the ceremony can start."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
