    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jailer",
        "text": "You can't go in."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#10$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "Look, I know a special visitor's permit is required to visit and deliver supplies. I just forgot."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "Can you accommodate me this once? My old classmate went in a couple of days ago, all of a sudden. His family asked me to bring him some stuff."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jailer",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "Alright, to tell you the truth, he's pretty sick."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#11$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "The Athenian jail has a doctor and basic medicine, but it's not as effective as the Rhodes Island stuff. He could have an attack while in custody, if he doesn't get proper treatment."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jailer",
        "text": "Save your breath, it's no use."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#10$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "Alright. I didn't want to do this..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "Here's my pass. Hek\u00e1demos, Grammate\u00fas to the Astynomos."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "I am authorized to enter detention facilities, even bring in suspects for questioning. Open the door. This is an order. I will file the necessary paperwork later."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jailer",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jailer",
        "text": "You want to see the two thieves who came in a few days ago?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "text": "Lykeion is not a...",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#8$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "text": "Never mind. Yes.",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jailer",
        "text": "You can't."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#5$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "What? Why not?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jailer",
        "text": "You are authorized to see prisoners held at the jail, but the two you're looking for aren't here anymore."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#4$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "text": "Were they transferred?",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#3$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "text": "That is unusual. Has Kyr\u00eda Athopoulou's Oripathy treatment system been implemented already?",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2070_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Hek\u00e1demos",
        "text": "Where were they transferred?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2089_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jailer",
        "text": "Don't bother, Hek\u00e1demos. I don't know who they are to you, but not even the Grammate\u00fas to the Astynomos is authorized to see inmates on death row."
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
