        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clerk",
        "text": "Sorry, Kyr\u00eda Athopoulou..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#18$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Does Lydia... I mean, does the Astynomos really not have the time?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "I heard that Xanthos and his apprentice were arrested for theft."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "They're my patients, and in a key stage of treatment, as the Rhodes Island clinic already reported."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#18$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Xanthos's Blood Originium-Crystal Density is particularly high, which could potentially lead to an acute attack of Oripathy. I would like to deliver medicine to them..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clerk",
        "text": "Look, I don't understand any of the medical jargon you're throwing around."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clerk",
        "text": "We are all very grateful to you for returning to Athenius, bringing back medical knowledge that you learned abroad and establishing an Oripathy clinic, but..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clerk",
        "text": "I shouldn't talk too much, but you're a good doctor, and the Astynomos' sister. You really should keep your distance from her for a few days at least, if only for the sake of your relationship."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clerk",
        "text": "The official line says the crime was theft, but the Sargonian ambassador came here a few days ago and said the thing that was stolen wasn't the ambassador's personal item, but an important relic for the exchange ceremony."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clerk",
        "text": "He put a lot of pressure on Lydia. They're probably going to be publicly charged with treason, once the ceremony is over."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#11$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "Treason?! But according to Minoan law\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clerk",
        "text": "Most of the issues the Astynomos faces cannot be solved through legal procedures."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clerk",
        "text": "She wants a new, modern Minos, and she is willing to give everything for it. That's why we're willing to work for her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clerk",
        "text": "Perhaps you're not aware, but she gave up her family inheritance, even chasing her other family out of Athenius after taking office..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#11$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "text": "She gave up her inheritance?",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#18$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "text": "I thought the business failed...",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clerk",
        "text": "This exchange of relics is an important part of her administration. There must be no mistake, at least not on the surface... even if it means sacrificing two lives. It's not like they're innocent, after all."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lena",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2075_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clerk",
        "text": "I'm sorry... I have to get back to work."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6,
            "channel": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "stopsound",
        "params": {
            "channel": 2,
            "fadetime": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
