    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$plot_intro",
            "key": "$plot_loop",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "You've been staring out the window, Astynomos."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "Apologies, Hi\u00e9reia Kassandra."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "Why not let Kyr\u00eda Athopoulou in? I have to discuss the establishment of an Oripathy treatment system with her anyway."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "Oh? I thought you wanted to get extra help to plead the case of the two Infected who were arrested a few days ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "You know that ferryman, Xanthos, quite well. I believe you were the one who found him the job at the crossing?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "The peace officers will deal with this theft. Neither of us need to worry about it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "I'm afraid I don't have that luxury. If this incident affects the trust between us and Sargon, then this incident will become more than a simple theft..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#5$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "What?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "It's my own business. It has nothing to do with a priestess of Endymion Temple."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#2$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "Back on topic, Hi\u00e9reia Kassandra. The opening play for tomorrow's exchange ceremony has been decided. It is to be <i>King Pertheus</i>, a popular classic across Terra."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "All the priests need to do is attend. There will be no need for complicated rituals."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "A few weeks ago, I came to discuss the priest-directed ceremonial play for the completion of Kereseira's First Temple. I have not seen you at the Astynomos' Office since."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "I apologize. My schedule is a busy one. I certainly remember. The exchange ceremony also requires an opening play, and we can kill two fowlbeasts with one stone this way. We need not bother the priests, however."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "Excuse me, but the rebuilding of Kereseira's First Temple is a symbol of the people's spirit. Now that it is complete, tradition calls for a proper ceremony to invite the heroes to enter the temple and give Minos their blessings."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "The council is not trying to usurp your administrative power, and the exchange ceremony does fall within your responsibility."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#10$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "However, Minoan drama began as a ritualistic performance."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "Every single detail is carefully arranged, from the props to the program to the performers. It's not enough to simply put on a popular play."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "'Immortal legend'... 'witness of the oracle'... 'heroic relic'..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "Do not think that I am completely ignorant of traditional ceremony, or that I'm one of those radicals who calls for every tradition to be abolished."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "But even if you have your choice of the program and control over the troupe, there is still something missing from the traditional ritual that you want, isn't there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "...The Sargonian mission brought Kereseira's harp."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#4$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "Oh? You <i>do</i> recognize the relic's ritual significance?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#8$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "...What do you mean?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "I'm neither an archaeologist nor a historian. As Astynomos, however, I understand every priest who sits on the council, including you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "You are the head priestess of Endymion Temple, and endowed with the divine gift of speaking on behalf of the heroes. Your knowledge of heroic epics puts most scholars to shame."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "Yet you showed no interest about the harp of Kereseira that the Sargonian mission brought with them. You didn't even ask to see it."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "I don't know why exactly, but I can tell that the harp the Sargonian mission brought was not the heroic relic that you knew."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "The ceremonial play could not have been performed to begin with."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "No, I already..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
